WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:01.043 --> 00:00:03.045
[theme music playing]

2
00:00:58.517 --> 00:01:00.978
NEWTOPIA

3
00:01:02.021 --> 00:01:02.937
[zombies snarling]

4
00:01:02.938 --> 00:01:05.149
- [Chef Jung grunting]
- [Soo-jeong shouting]

5
00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:11.280
They're getting through the glass.

6
00:01:12.114 --> 00:01:13.281
[wailing] Help me!

7
00:01:13.282 --> 00:01:15.034
Help me! Help.

8
00:01:16.577 --> 00:01:17.869
Jae-yoon, help me here.

9
00:01:17.870 --> 00:01:19.246
[Jae-yoon grunts]

10
00:01:20.581 --> 00:01:21.415
[gasps]

11
00:01:21.999 --> 00:01:22.833
[panting]

12
00:01:23.292 --> 00:01:24.835
Jae-yoon, we need help!

13
00:01:25.836 --> 00:01:27.671
- [Chef Jung grunting]
- [In-ho yelling]

14
00:01:34.345 --> 00:01:35.428
[canister clattering]

15
00:01:35.429 --> 00:01:36.347
[lighter clicks]

16
00:01:36.847 --> 00:01:38.515
On three, everybody get away!

17
00:01:38.516 --> 00:01:40.058
Jae-yoon found something.

18
00:01:40.059 --> 00:01:42.478
- [Jae-yoon grunting]
- [Chef Jung] Hurry up!

19
00:01:43.187 --> 00:01:45.855
- One, two...
- [glass crackles]

20
00:01:45.856 --> 00:01:47.857
- [Soo-jeong] Oh, God.
- ...three.

21
00:01:47.858 --> 00:01:49.235
[Soo-jeong shouts]

22
00:01:52.947 --> 00:01:54.949
[zombies snarling, screeching]

23
00:01:57.409 --> 00:01:59.702
In-ho, hey! The emergency door.

24
00:01:59.703 --> 00:02:01.079
[all panting]

25
00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:03.498
- Quick, quick.
- [In-ho whimpering] Okay, okay.

26
00:02:03.499 --> 00:02:04.791
- Get the scraper.
- Scraper.

27
00:02:04.792 --> 00:02:06.585
[Soo-jeong whimpers]

28
00:02:07.211 --> 00:02:09.213
[fire alarm ringing]

29
00:02:11.131 --> 00:02:13.384
[zombies snarling]

30
00:02:20.599 --> 00:02:23.060
We're in a top-of-the-line
luxury hotel right now.

31
00:02:23.769 --> 00:02:26.480
We have the best sprinklers
in the business.

32
00:02:29.191 --> 00:02:30.441
[Jae-yoon gasps]

33
00:02:30.442 --> 00:02:31.943
[flames fizzling]

34
00:02:31.944 --> 00:02:33.069
[snarling]

35
00:02:33.070 --> 00:02:34.737
- Run!
- [all yelling]

36
00:02:34.738 --> 00:02:36.240
[Chef Jung] Go, go, go.

37
00:02:39.326 --> 00:02:41.160
- [Soo-jeong shouts]
- [In-ho whimpers]

38
00:02:41.161 --> 00:02:42.621
[Jae-yoon] Go, go, run.

39
00:02:44.874 --> 00:02:45.708
[snarling]

40
00:02:46.125 --> 00:02:48.252
- [all screaming]
- [In-ho] Oh, fuck.

41
00:02:49.044 --> 00:02:50.169
[Jae-yoon] Whoa, whoa.

42
00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:52.006
[all grunting]

43
00:02:55.551 --> 00:02:57.011
[In-ho yells]

44
00:02:59.096 --> 00:03:00.430
[Jae-yoon] We did it. [sighs]

45
00:03:00.431 --> 00:03:02.474
[all panting]

46
00:03:03.267 --> 00:03:04.685
[Soo-jeong coughs]

47
00:03:05.269 --> 00:03:06.729
[Chef Jung exhales, thuds]

48
00:03:08.063 --> 00:03:09.564
- No, Chef Jung.
- Chef Jung.

49
00:03:09.565 --> 00:03:11.065
- Are you okay?
- Chef Jung.

50
00:03:11.066 --> 00:03:12.734
- I got him here.
- [Jae-yoon grunts]

51
00:03:12.735 --> 00:03:14.527
- [Soo-jeong grunts]
- Hey, Ra In-ho.

52
00:03:14.528 --> 00:03:16.071
Help him get upstairs.

53
00:03:16.488 --> 00:03:17.655
Go look for help, okay?

54
00:03:17.656 --> 00:03:19.949
Okay. Soo, let's go.

55
00:03:19.950 --> 00:03:21.284
Hurry up! Hurry.

56
00:03:21.285 --> 00:03:23.454
- Chef Jung, think you can walk?
- [grunts]

57
00:03:24.079 --> 00:03:24.914
Here we go.

58
00:03:26.832 --> 00:03:29.417
- [In-ho] Come on, Soo-jeong.
- [Soo-jeong] Wait for me.

59
00:03:29.418 --> 00:03:32.337
- [In-ho] Hurry up!
- Wait, let's go together.

60
00:03:32.338 --> 00:03:34.423
[whimsical music playing]

61
00:03:58.572 --> 00:03:59.698
This way. Over here.

62
00:04:05.287 --> 00:04:06.746
- Whoa.
- [Young-joo gasps]

63
00:04:06.747 --> 00:04:08.581
This is a lot of people, Jin-wook.

64
00:04:08.582 --> 00:04:10.917
Look, just trust me. We have to stay here.

65
00:04:10.918 --> 00:04:12.460
[Young-joo sighs]

66
00:04:12.461 --> 00:04:14.046
I don't see police in there.

67
00:04:14.463 --> 00:04:15.631
What are they doing?

68
00:04:17.633 --> 00:04:19.467
[gasps] Alex, hi!

69
00:04:19.468 --> 00:04:23.138
- [all shushing]
- Oh! I'm sorry. Sorry.

70
00:04:24.056 --> 00:04:25.349
Hey, are you really Alex?

71
00:04:25.975 --> 00:04:28.476
- It is you. Alex.
- [Tae-shik] Not me. Wrong guy.

72
00:04:28.477 --> 00:04:30.270
No, I don't know who that is.

73
00:04:31.772 --> 00:04:32.731
Nope, I'm not.

74
00:04:34.650 --> 00:04:36.442
- [Tae-shik sighs]
- Alex.

75
00:04:36.443 --> 00:04:38.195
I'm really happy to see you.

76
00:04:39.113 --> 00:04:41.448
- Are you all good?
- My legs hurt, but I'm fine.

77
00:04:42.992 --> 00:04:44.159
You doing good, though?

78
00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:46.787
- Yeah, I'm great.
- But your clothes.

79
00:04:48.038 --> 00:04:48.872
[Jin-wook] Uh...

80
00:04:50.874 --> 00:04:52.543
Uh, anyway, um...

81
00:04:53.168 --> 00:04:54.794
What's going on? There's no cops?

82
00:04:54.795 --> 00:04:56.296
- [Young-joo] Hmm?
- No. No one.

83
00:04:56.964 --> 00:04:59.841
I've been waiting for them.
They won't show up, though,

84
00:04:59.842 --> 00:05:02.385
so I thought with all
those people in there,

85
00:05:02.386 --> 00:05:04.178
it might get pretty dangerous.

86
00:05:04.179 --> 00:05:06.056
- So I came out.
- [Young-joo] Ah!

87
00:05:07.933 --> 00:05:09.435
Well, they're gonna come back.

88
00:05:10.185 --> 00:05:12.145
- Well, what now?
- We just got here.

89
00:05:12.146 --> 00:05:13.771
Alex, kindly. You can go now.

90
00:05:13.772 --> 00:05:15.732
We'll stay here and wait for the cops.

91
00:05:15.733 --> 00:05:18.484
Alex, wait with us for a little bit.
Ten more minutes.

92
00:05:18.485 --> 00:05:19.569
Sure, that's fine.

93
00:05:19.570 --> 00:05:21.405
- Why do we need to wait together?
- Hush!

94
00:05:22.322 --> 00:05:24.991
- [Jin-wook sighs]
- Hey. Why is everyone so quiet?

95
00:05:24.992 --> 00:05:26.493
So the zombies don't hear.

96
00:05:26.827 --> 00:05:28.911
There was a fight 'cause a phone went off.

97
00:05:28.912 --> 00:05:31.039
Turn off your phone. You, too.

98
00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:32.750
It's gone. I got robbed earlier.

99
00:05:34.543 --> 00:05:37.296
{\an8}I'll come and find you.
Jae-yoon, I'm at the police station. Wait!

100
00:05:41.717 --> 00:05:42.593
[exhales]

101
00:05:47.556 --> 00:05:49.558
[tense music playing]

102
00:05:54.813 --> 00:05:56.065
Sergeant, are you scared?

103
00:05:57.941 --> 00:06:00.486
I'm not, sir. Not one bit.

104
00:06:01.779 --> 00:06:04.156
Keep your head on straight.
Same as always.

105
00:06:05.741 --> 00:06:08.577
Just remember your training
and we're both gonna make it.

106
00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:11.371
Yes, sir. Of course.

107
00:06:14.291 --> 00:06:16.293
[ominous music playing]

108
00:06:21.632 --> 00:06:22.674
WARNING - MILITARY RESTRICTED AREA

109
00:06:23.967 --> 00:06:25.469
Oh, shi-- What are you doing?

110
00:06:26.095 --> 00:06:28.221
- I came back to help.
- Ra In-ho.

111
00:06:28.222 --> 00:06:30.724
- Ra In-ho.
- Salute, sir!

112
00:06:33.227 --> 00:06:35.187
- Oh, shit.
- [Soo-jeong] Wait.

113
00:06:35.979 --> 00:06:37.772
We're not zombies. Don't shoot.

114
00:06:37.773 --> 00:06:40.233
- Ra in-ho. What's going on?
- [In-ho] She's normal.

115
00:06:40.234 --> 00:06:42.985
She's really not a zombie.
I give you my word.

116
00:06:42.986 --> 00:06:44.446
- I swear.
- Guns down.

117
00:06:44.988 --> 00:06:47.115
[Gye-young] Huh? Hey, Soo-jeong.

118
00:06:47.116 --> 00:06:48.533
What happened? What's wrong?

119
00:06:48.534 --> 00:06:49.575
Are you an idiot?

120
00:06:49.576 --> 00:06:51.953
Why did you come out
without guarding your post?

121
00:06:51.954 --> 00:06:54.331
- Hey, Ra In-ho. Is Lee Jae-yoon with you?
- Ah!

122
00:06:56.291 --> 00:06:59.210
Lee Jae-yoon, hurry up!
Master Sergeant, let us through.

123
00:06:59.211 --> 00:07:01.380
We got in, come on!

124
00:07:02.381 --> 00:07:03.464
Private Lee Jae-yoon!

125
00:07:03.465 --> 00:07:05.967
- [Hyung-bae] Who is with him?
- [Gye-young] Chef Jung.

126
00:07:05.968 --> 00:07:08.719
- [Hyung-bae] What if he's a zombie?
- [In-ho] I'm going down.

127
00:07:08.720 --> 00:07:10.972
- [Chef Jung grunts]
- [Soo-jeong] They need help.

128
00:07:10.973 --> 00:07:13.057
[Young-man] Stay back.
Give them some space.

129
00:07:13.058 --> 00:07:15.059
- [Young-man] Sir.
- [Tae-hwa] Who's that?

130
00:07:15.060 --> 00:07:17.145
- [Young-man] Jae-yoon and--
- [Tae-hwa] No.

131
00:07:17.146 --> 00:07:19.313
Who told you to let civilians in the unit?

132
00:07:19.314 --> 00:07:20.314
[Jae-yoon panting]

133
00:07:20.315 --> 00:07:22.734
[Tae-hwa] Does this look
like a shelter to you?

134
00:07:24.278 --> 00:07:25.279
[Jae-yoon] Young-joo.

135
00:07:26.905 --> 00:07:29.323
I looked earlier.
It's happening everywhere.

136
00:07:29.324 --> 00:07:32.118
It looks like Europe and the US
have been going crazy

137
00:07:32.119 --> 00:07:33.452
since a few days ago.

138
00:07:33.453 --> 00:07:35.997
And now it's like
the whole world's going crazy.

139
00:07:35.998 --> 00:07:38.958
Oh. Where did this even come from?

140
00:07:38.959 --> 00:07:41.586
[sighs] There's a lot of
theories about that.

141
00:07:41.587 --> 00:07:44.839
But some think it came
from a Komodo dragon this guy ate,

142
00:07:44.840 --> 00:07:46.924
or it started with Chinese scientists,

143
00:07:46.925 --> 00:07:48.802
or it's a weapon for North Korea.

144
00:07:49.386 --> 00:07:52.180
Others think it could have
been global warming.

145
00:07:52.181 --> 00:07:53.932
What about global warming?

146
00:07:54.474 --> 00:07:57.351
It melts in Antarctic,
and when the temperature got high,

147
00:07:57.352 --> 00:07:59.313
permafrost finally melted,

148
00:07:59.980 --> 00:08:03.025
causing an ancient virus
to escape from the ice and spread.

149
00:08:03.734 --> 00:08:06.277
But anyway, no one knows where it's from.

150
00:08:06.278 --> 00:08:08.487
- [sighs] Great.
- I think you could've--

151
00:08:08.488 --> 00:08:10.072
- [man] Move, go!
- [Young-joo] huh?

152
00:08:10.073 --> 00:08:13.118
[man] You're all in the way.
Why are you blocking the door?

153
00:08:13.744 --> 00:08:16.037
We need weapons or something.

154
00:08:16.038 --> 00:08:18.749
Go somewhere else,
if you're just gonna stand there.

155
00:08:19.291 --> 00:08:22.961
- [Young-joo] Who are those people?
- They're really rude, whoever they are.

156
00:08:23.921 --> 00:08:25.297
They're hunters, I think.

157
00:08:26.131 --> 00:08:27.840
I think they're looking for their guns.

158
00:08:27.841 --> 00:08:31.219
Why would their guns be
in the police station though?

159
00:08:31.220 --> 00:08:34.472
It's the law. Hunters can't keep
their guns during off season.

160
00:08:34.473 --> 00:08:35.932
They're kept by the police.

161
00:08:35.933 --> 00:08:38.018
Oh, is that really the law?

162
00:08:38.685 --> 00:08:42.564
[sighs] in this situation,
having you own gun give you the best shot.

163
00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:47.527
Police officers, those hunters,
soldiers, whatever.

164
00:08:49.780 --> 00:08:50.781
Soldiers.

165
00:08:54.243 --> 00:08:56.452
[inhales] Young-joo.

166
00:08:56.453 --> 00:08:57.704
Lee Jae-yoon, get up!

167
00:08:59.122 --> 00:09:01.082
You let civilians into our unit.

168
00:09:01.083 --> 00:09:03.292
- What are you doing?
- [Jae-yoon] Sir...

169
00:09:03.293 --> 00:09:05.003
Right now, that's not important.

170
00:09:06.463 --> 00:09:07.839
Yeah, This is an emergency.

171
00:09:09.049 --> 00:09:11.926
- Sir, can I please have my phone--
- Get it together, Jae-yoon.

172
00:09:11.927 --> 00:09:13.011
[Soo-jeong] Hey!

173
00:09:14.346 --> 00:09:17.473
We should all call our families
with everything going on.

174
00:09:17.474 --> 00:09:19.809
[Tae-hwa] Respectfully,
you need to go now.

175
00:09:19.810 --> 00:09:21.227
Sir, excuse me. [chuckles]

176
00:09:21.228 --> 00:09:23.813
This is Soo-Jeong
from the VIP lounge at the hotel--

177
00:09:23.814 --> 00:09:25.190
Kwak Gye-young, be quiet!

178
00:09:27.943 --> 00:09:29.860
Hotel employee or not,

179
00:09:29.861 --> 00:09:31.612
this is a secured military unit.

180
00:09:31.613 --> 00:09:34.700
- We strictly prohibit civilian entry.
- [loud thud in distance]

181
00:09:36.493 --> 00:09:38.160
[thudding continues]

182
00:09:38.161 --> 00:09:39.413
What the hell was that?

183
00:09:40.122 --> 00:09:42.415
Sir, we don't have any time to debate.

184
00:09:42.416 --> 00:09:44.584
Zombies are approaching the door!

185
00:09:46.545 --> 00:09:49.463
We need to close it
or we're all gonna die.

186
00:09:49.464 --> 00:09:50.757
They're breaking in.

187
00:09:51.550 --> 00:09:53.968
Jeon Hyung-bae, Choi Chul-woo!
Close both doors!

188
00:09:53.969 --> 00:09:57.054
- Private Hyung-bae, yes sir!
- Private Choi Chul-woo, yes sir!

189
00:09:57.055 --> 00:09:59.057
[snarling]

190
00:09:59.641 --> 00:10:01.435
- [In-ho whimpers]
- Come on, come on.

191
00:10:02.811 --> 00:10:04.021
[Chul-woo] Lock it!

192
00:10:05.939 --> 00:10:07.024
[Young-man] Oh, shit.

193
00:10:07.482 --> 00:10:09.525
[doors rattling]

194
00:10:09.526 --> 00:10:11.736
- [Chef Jung groans]
- [Soo-jeong] Are you okay?

195
00:10:11.737 --> 00:10:13.738
[Young-man] Why is he like that?

196
00:10:13.739 --> 00:10:16.407
I think you need to
start explaining Jae-yoon.

197
00:10:16.408 --> 00:10:17.701
Yes, sir, Sergeant.

198
00:10:18.660 --> 00:10:21.162
Uh... Yes, Sergeant--

199
00:10:21.163 --> 00:10:22.706
- [doors thudding]
- [all exclaim]

200
00:10:24.499 --> 00:10:28.169
[Jae-yoon] If those doors open,
then they're gonna murder all of us.

201
00:10:28.170 --> 00:10:29.838
- Oh, my God!
- What's back there?

202
00:10:30.922 --> 00:10:33.050
That's... a horde of zombies.

203
00:10:33.675 --> 00:10:35.760
You think that's funny, shitstain?

204
00:10:35.761 --> 00:10:38.388
- Private Ra In-ho.
- Mr. Soldier.

205
00:10:38.972 --> 00:10:40.640
Do you think this is a joke?

206
00:10:42.851 --> 00:10:45.812
How the hell could anyone joke
about something like this?

207
00:10:55.614 --> 00:10:57.199
Bring the two of them inside.

208
00:10:58.075 --> 00:11:00.785
- They'll stay in the barracks.
- Yes, right away.

209
00:11:00.786 --> 00:11:03.705
- [Chef Jung groans]
- Now, come on, Chef Jung.

210
00:11:04.873 --> 00:11:06.207
Whoa, whoa!

211
00:11:06.208 --> 00:11:08.751
- [In-ho] No. Chef Jung.
- [Young-man] What's wrong?

212
00:11:08.752 --> 00:11:10.170
[Tae-hwa] What's going on?

213
00:11:11.588 --> 00:11:12.672
Is he okay?

214
00:11:13.882 --> 00:11:15.884
[zombies snarling in distance]

215
00:11:19.638 --> 00:11:21.013
I don't feel any breathing.

216
00:11:21.014 --> 00:11:23.100
- [banging on doors]
- [all gasping]

217
00:11:24.976 --> 00:11:26.769
Be careful not to misfire.

218
00:11:26.770 --> 00:11:28.897
Blanks are dangerous at close range.

219
00:11:30.482 --> 00:11:32.234
[Gye-young] Oh, no. Oh, no.

220
00:11:33.276 --> 00:11:34.861
[Soo-jeong] Hey, Chef Jung?

221
00:11:35.779 --> 00:11:36.822
Chef?

222
00:11:39.574 --> 00:11:40.867
- [Jae-yoon grunts]
- Chef Jung?

223
00:11:41.451 --> 00:11:42.536
Chef, are you okay?

224
00:11:43.620 --> 00:11:44.912
[Chef Jung snarling]

225
00:11:44.913 --> 00:11:47.456
[In-ho and Jae-yoon whimpering]

226
00:11:47.457 --> 00:11:49.543
[ominous music playing]

227
00:11:50.836 --> 00:11:52.838
[indistinct chattering]

228
00:11:54.840 --> 00:11:57.049
[Tae-shik] I think I'm gonna
get out of here.

229
00:11:57.050 --> 00:12:00.261
What? Where are you going?
You know, somewhere safer than here?

230
00:12:00.262 --> 00:12:03.765
It's better to be someplace
where fewer people around.

231
00:12:05.434 --> 00:12:06.851
- [grunts]
- Alex is right.

232
00:12:06.852 --> 00:12:09.521
There's no police.
What's the point of waiting here?

233
00:12:10.772 --> 00:12:13.566
[sighs] I don't know.

234
00:12:13.567 --> 00:12:15.359
- [gunshot fires]
- [all yelling]

235
00:12:15.360 --> 00:12:17.529
- [people shouting]
- [Jin-wook] What?

236
00:12:19.197 --> 00:12:21.073
[snarling]

237
00:12:21.074 --> 00:12:22.742
[people screaming]

238
00:12:24.161 --> 00:12:25.328
Wait, what is that?

239
00:12:26.705 --> 00:12:28.582
- [Young-joo screams]
- Get out of here.

240
00:12:29.541 --> 00:12:30.833
Come on. Young-joo.

241
00:12:30.834 --> 00:12:32.334
Run.

