362
00:18:23.186 --> 00:18:24.144
Sir, wait a minute.

363
00:18:24.145 --> 00:18:25.062
Just be careful.

364
00:18:25.063 --> 00:18:27.148
[Chul-woo whimpering]

365
00:18:27.774 --> 00:18:29.858
- How's he doing?
- [Soo-jeong] Shit.

366
