- [Gye-young] Chul-woo!

369
00:18:42.580 --> 00:18:43.998
[Tae-hwa] Choi Chul-woo!

370
00:18:44.666 --> 00:18:45.583
Just relax.

371
00:18:46.668 --> 00:18:47.627
Chul-woo.

372
00:18:48.711 --> 00:18:50.713
