384
00:19:33.298 --> 00:19:35.592
It's not your fault. Get up, get up.

385
00:19:36.134 --> 00:19:37.426
It's okay. You're all right.

386
00:19:37.427 --> 00:19:38.969
Christ's sake.

387
00:19:38.970 --> 00:19:40.220
- It's not your fault.
- Jesus.

388
00:19:40.221 --> 00:19:42.598
Told you all to stay
on your guard out here!

389
00:19:42.599 --> 00:19:44.684
[Hyung-bae crying]

390
00:19:46.019 --> 00:19:47.978
