with Chul-woo. Hyung-bae!

392
00:19:49.981 --> 00:19:51.481
- [Young-man] Sir.
- Yes, sir.

393
00:19:51.482 --> 00:19:53.525
- Bring the civilian inside.
- Yes, sir.

394
00:19:53.526 --> 00:19:54.611
Now go.

395
00:19:55.862 --> 00:19:57.154
Lee Jae-yoon, Ra In-ho.

396
00:19:57.155 --> 00:19:59.908
- Private Lee Jae-yoon.
- Private Ra In-ho.

397
00:20:00.617 --> 00:20:02.243
Follow me to the situation room.

398
00:20:02.577 --> 00:20:06.456
Hey, First Sergeant? Am I allowed?

399
00:20:08.666 --> 00:20:09.626
[Tae-hwa sighs]

400
00:20:15.924 --> 00:20:17.842
Yes, of course. You're coming with us.

401
00:20:25.808 --> 00:20:26.893
