a civilian is here.

437
00:22:02.739 --> 00:22:04.573
Do not allow that
to shake your discipline.

438
00:22:04.574 --> 00:22:06.992
- [all] Yes, sir.
- [both] Yes, sir. Of course.

439
00:22:06.993 --> 00:22:09.829
