- Sir, I... will lend her mine.

445
00:22:22.467 --> 00:22:23.551
Sure you do that.

446
00:22:24.135 --> 00:22:26.387
- Maintain your discipline.
- Yes, sir.

447
00:22:28.306 --> 00:22:29.765
