[Young-joo clicks tongue, sighs]

486
00:24:33.806 --> 00:24:35.141
I know. I'm sorry.

487
00:24:39.645 --> 00:24:40.688
No, hey.

488
00:24:41.272 --> 00:24:43.649
I wasn't fishing for an apology. Hmm?

489
00:24:45.818 --> 00:24:46.652
Oh.

490
00:24:49.655 --> 00:24:50.489
[gasps]

491
00:24:51.032 --> 00:24:53.742
FOR SALE - 10,000 WON PER UNIT

492
00:24:53.743 --> 00:24:54.952
[exclaims in surprise]

493
00:24:56.829 --> 00:24:57.830
That's crazy.

494
00:24:58.497 --> 00:25:01.167
This is the same album that
Jae-yoon had been wanting.

495
00:25:02.293 --> 00:25:04.212
Hey, do you know what that is, though?

496
00:25:05.338 --> 00:25:06.963
A cassette tape, yeah.

497
00:25:06.964 --> 00:25:09.383
All right. Well, you know it. Mmm.

498
00:25:11.052 --> 00:25:14.763
{\an8}YOON JONG-SHIN - GUIDELINES FOR THOSE
WHO HAVE BROKEN UP LIVE

499
00:25:14.764 --> 00:25:19.685
[song playing] <i>♪ The agony you left ♪</i>

500
00:25:19.894 --> 00:25:23.147
<i>♪ To me ♪</i>

501
00:25:23.397 --> 00:25:29.946
♪ Annie, will you hear me on the radio ♪

502
00:25:30.238 --> 00:25:32.781
JAE-YOON'S PLAYLIST - 572 SONGS

503
00:25:32.782 --> 00:25:36.619
[sighs] Why do you always listen
to Yoon Jong-shin?

504
00:25:38.204 --> 00:25:40.581
Because it's so good.

505
00:25:43.376 --> 00:25:47.171
Well, at this rate,
these lyrics will get stuck in my head.

506
00:25:48.130 --> 00:25:49.840
Well, let 'em get stuck then.

507
00:25:51.676 --> 00:25:55.554
[singing] <i>♪ Hey you charming clown ♪</i>

508
00:25:55.680 --> 00:25:58.808
[laughs] Oh, that's not how you sing!

509
00:25:59.141 --> 00:26:03.396
[singing] <i>♪ I love you more than you
could know ♪</i>

510
00:26:04.105 --> 00:26:05.690
[laughs]

511
00:26:06.691 --> 00:26:12.321
{\an8}[singing] <i>♪ No one's ever been
so comforting to me ♪</i>

512
00:26:12.738 --> 00:26:15.908
{\an8}[singing] <i>♪ You cured my lifelong pain ♪</i>

513
00:26:16.117 --> 00:26:21.372
{\an8}[singing] <i>♪ Yes you're the one
who made my smile again ♪</i>

514
00:26:21.497 --> 00:26:27.044
[song playing] <i>♪ Can you feel the love ♪</i>

515
00:26:30.006 --> 00:26:32.048
The owner is probably dead now.

516
00:26:32.049 --> 00:26:34.259
Why would you ask me
for money to pay for this?

517
00:26:34.260 --> 00:26:36.136
How do you know he's dead?

518
00:26:36.137 --> 00:26:38.305
And if we don't pay, then we're stealing.

519
00:26:38.306 --> 00:26:40.598
I'm an idiot for lending it
to you. [scoffs]

520
00:26:40.599 --> 00:26:42.018
This shit's so frustrating.

521
00:26:45.730 --> 00:26:47.732
[line ringing]

522
00:26:48.691 --> 00:26:50.608
[voicemail]
<i>The person you are trying to reach</i>

523
00:26:50.609 --> 00:26:52.152
<i>- is currently unavailable.</i>
- Shit.

524
00:26:52.153 --> 00:26:53.696
[voicemail] <i>...hear the beep.</i>

525
00:26:54.697 --> 00:26:56.073
[line ringing]

526
00:26:57.783 --> 00:26:59.659
[voicemail]
<i>The person you are trying to reach</i>

527
00:26:59.660 --> 00:27:01.244
<i>- is currently unavailable.</i>
- [sighs]

528
00:27:01.245 --> 00:27:03.038
{\an8}MY DEAR GRANDMA

529
00:27:03.039 --> 00:27:05.124
{\an8}[line ringing]

530
00:27:12.757 --> 00:27:13.758
[exhales]

531
00:27:15.217 --> 00:27:16.843
You have to be more careful.

532
00:27:16.844 --> 00:27:18.887
[Soo-jeong's brother]
<i>You should be careful.</i>

533
00:27:18.888 --> 00:27:20.096
Hey, I gotta go, okay?

534
00:27:20.097 --> 00:27:22.307
<i>- Okay, uh, be careful with strangers.</i>
- Uh-huh.

535
00:27:22.308 --> 00:27:23.767
Don't follow--

536
00:27:23.768 --> 00:27:25.352
- Oh, my gosh.
- Sorry, I just...

537
00:27:25.353 --> 00:27:28.189
- I brought you a tissue to...
- [sobbing]

538
00:27:29.023 --> 00:27:31.609
- Are you okay?
- [Soo-jeong blows nose]

539
00:27:32.902 --> 00:27:34.612
Hey, Ms. Soo-jeong, was that...

540
00:27:35.404 --> 00:27:37.573
[chuckles] ...you boyfriend?

541
00:27:38.074 --> 00:27:41.534
- No, it was my brother.
- [exclaims in relief]

542
00:27:41.535 --> 00:27:44.205
Uh, right, of course. [chuckling]

543
00:27:45.373 --> 00:27:47.458
Why do you keep calling me Ms. Soo-jeong?

544
00:27:48.793 --> 00:27:49.877
Uh...

545
00:27:51.003 --> 00:27:53.839
[chuckles] Then shall we talk casually?

546
00:27:56.092 --> 00:27:57.551
How old are you anyway?

547
00:27:59.595 --> 00:28:00.763
However old you want.

548
00:28:01.764 --> 00:28:04.015
When you came to visit me on Chuseok,

549
00:28:04.016 --> 00:28:06.769
you and your aunts made braised
short ribs for everyone.

550
00:28:08.896 --> 00:28:11.899
There was a guy who was ripped
and only ate the salad.

551
00:28:12.900 --> 00:28:14.652
Yeah, yeah, yeah, that's right.

552
00:28:14.860 --> 00:28:16.903
The guy that dropped out
of his phys-ed degree

553
00:28:16.904 --> 00:28:18.989
after the first semester to join the Army,

554
00:28:19.865 --> 00:28:21.367
[sobbing]

555
00:28:22.326 --> 00:28:25.121
Now he's dead. [crying]

556
00:28:37.550 --> 00:28:39.343
MARTIAL LAW, WHERE IS THE PRESIDENT?

557
00:28:40.803 --> 00:28:42.263
[Kyung-sik] Martial law...

558
00:28:47.101 --> 00:28:47.935
[blows out]

559
00:28:52.398 --> 00:28:54.316
[Young-joo] <i>Jae-yoon,
I'm on my way to you now.</i>

560
00:28:55.025 --> 00:28:57.026
<i>I'm going to the restaurant at the hotel.</i>

561
00:28:57.027 --> 00:28:59.488
<i>If you can come down,
I'd like to see your face.</i>

562
00:28:59.738 --> 00:29:01.115
<i>We can meet there and talk.</i>

563
00:29:01.699 --> 00:29:03.575
[sobs] <i>Why aren't you answering?</i>

564
00:29:03.576 --> 00:29:05.202
<i>You're still in the unit, right?</i>

565
00:29:05.828 --> 00:29:09.331
<i>Jae-yoon, I'm at Gangnam station
but people are acting really weird.</i>

566
00:29:09.874 --> 00:29:11.332
<i>Please tell me you're okay.</i>

567
00:29:11.333 --> 00:29:13.793
<i>There's a lot of chaos
going on outside right now,</i>

568
00:29:13.794 --> 00:29:14.961
[Jae-yoon sobbing]

569
00:29:14.962 --> 00:29:17.298
<i>Jae-yoon, please call me
when you see this.</i>

570
00:29:18.007 --> 00:29:19.633
<i>I'm right in front of the tower.</i>

571
00:29:20.342 --> 00:29:22.218
<i>If you see this, please just call me.</i>

572
00:29:22.219 --> 00:29:23.679
<i>I'll come and find you.</i>

573
00:29:24.430 --> 00:29:25.264
[crying] Oh...

574
00:29:25.973 --> 00:29:26.974
Oh, no.

575
00:29:27.433 --> 00:29:29.101
Oh, God. [sobbing]

576
00:29:30.186 --> 00:29:31.604
[In-ho] How's everyone else?

577
00:29:32.646 --> 00:29:33.647
Your parents?

578
00:29:34.940 --> 00:29:36.025
Oh, thank God.

579
00:29:36.817 --> 00:29:38.611
Anyway. Don't go outside again.

580
00:29:39.445 --> 00:29:42.490
No, honey, just stay inside.
It's too dangerous right now.

581
00:29:42.948 --> 00:29:44.949
You should have
what you need in the house.

582
00:29:44.950 --> 00:29:45.951
Hmm?

583
00:29:46.660 --> 00:29:48.454
Have you got enough food for the baby?

584
00:29:50.456 --> 00:29:52.625
Mm-hmm. Yeah, that's great.

585
00:29:53.542 --> 00:29:56.795
Yeah. Portion it and check the date.
So you're sure it's good.

586
00:29:57.463 --> 00:29:58.756
Mm-hmm.

587
00:29:59.381 --> 00:30:02.468
And, honey, this is really important.

588
00:30:03.010 --> 00:30:05.011
Water is gonna start getting scarce,

589
00:30:05.012 --> 00:30:07.473
so make sure you get
as much of it as you can.

590
00:30:11.769 --> 00:30:12.937
[shouts] Private Ra In-ho.

591
00:30:13.479 --> 00:30:16.231
I was on the phone.
I'm sorry, Private Lee Jae-yoon.

592
00:30:16.232 --> 00:30:17.900
Could you excuse me for a moment?

593
00:30:18.943 --> 00:30:21.528
Oh, uh, yeah, go ahead.

594
00:30:21.529 --> 00:30:22.613
Thank you, sir.

595
00:30:26.367 --> 00:30:28.077
[shouts] I'm sorry! [softly] Uh...

596
00:30:29.787 --> 00:30:31.080
Mm-hmm. I get it.

597
00:30:32.373 --> 00:30:33.541
My voice is different?

598
00:30:34.667 --> 00:30:37.002
No, I'm sure it's just
a thing with my nuts.

599
00:30:38.796 --> 00:30:39.797
[sighs]

600
00:30:44.802 --> 00:30:46.595
[scoffs] Well, that was a shock.

601
00:30:47.555 --> 00:30:48.722
Jae-yoon.

602
00:30:50.057 --> 00:30:51.307
Private, Lee Jae-yoon.

603
00:30:51.308 --> 00:30:53.601
Huh? Your voice dropped.
Let your guard down?

604
00:30:53.602 --> 00:30:55.104
- I'm sorry.
- Wow.

605
00:30:56.063 --> 00:30:57.439
[Gye-young sighs]

606
00:30:58.357 --> 00:31:00.317
So, Jae-yoon, talk to your parents yet?

607
00:31:00.734 --> 00:31:02.860
No. My parents are
currently out of the country.

608
00:31:02.861 --> 00:31:04.654
- They're traveling.
- Traveling where?

609
00:31:04.655 --> 00:31:07.156
- They're over in Africa.
- Africa.

610
00:31:07.157 --> 00:31:08.157
Sir, that's right.

611
00:31:08.158 --> 00:31:11.452
So, why are they there?
Do they work for the state?

612
00:31:11.453 --> 00:31:12.954
Uh, no, sir. Just retired.

613
00:31:12.955 --> 00:31:16.082
They wanna experience things
they haven't seen, and what not.

614
00:31:16.083 --> 00:31:18.377
Haven't seen before.
Haven't seen before...

615
00:31:19.211 --> 00:31:21.505
Like a lion, rhino, something like that?

616
00:31:22.089 --> 00:31:27.302
- [loudly] They'd like to see an elephant.
- Ah! Aren't they just so majestic?

617
00:31:27.303 --> 00:31:28.304
Sir, that's right.

618
00:31:30.055 --> 00:31:34.810
Well, Africa, could be okay.

619
00:31:35.394 --> 00:31:37.271
- [cell phone vibrates]
- [Jae-yoon] Uh.

620
00:31:41.108 --> 00:31:42.443
Ah, so sweet.

621
00:31:43.694 --> 00:31:45.403
At least we have something to eat.

622
00:31:45.404 --> 00:31:47.698
- [Young-joo chuckles]
- Any ramen around here?

623
00:31:49.283 --> 00:31:51.451
You live in Nowon,
and you're in Dogok-dong?

624
00:31:51.452 --> 00:31:53.369
Yeah, Dogok-dong. Where do you live?

625
00:31:53.370 --> 00:31:56.414
I live in Hong Kong.
But I'm at a hotel nearby for business.

626
00:31:56.415 --> 00:31:57.957
Hotel. You said?

627
00:31:57.958 --> 00:31:59.584
Which one do you mean? Eden?

628
00:31:59.585 --> 00:32:01.961
- Yeah, how do you know Eden?
- [Young-joo gasps]

629
00:32:01.962 --> 00:32:04.548
My boyfriend actually works
right above that hotel.

630
00:32:05.049 --> 00:32:06.425
What's on top of the hotel?

631
00:32:07.051 --> 00:32:09.886
I would say that he's serving the country.

632
00:32:09.887 --> 00:32:11.512
- What--
- There's an air defense unit

633
00:32:11.513 --> 00:32:13.473
above the hotel. He's stationed there.

634
00:32:13.474 --> 00:32:15.183
She wanted to visit him, so I took her,

635
00:32:15.184 --> 00:32:16.768
- and look what happened.
- Hold on...

636
00:32:16.769 --> 00:32:19.271
Is... Is this him right here? Look.

637
00:32:20.064 --> 00:32:22.023
We said no phones, didn't we?

638
00:32:22.024 --> 00:32:24.567
Hmm. I guess it was on. Huh. My bad.

639
00:32:24.568 --> 00:32:27.445
[gasps] That's Jae-yoon.

640
00:32:27.446 --> 00:32:29.322
[Tae-shik] Huh. No way.

641
00:32:29.323 --> 00:32:30.698
[Jin-wook] Is this him?

642
00:32:30.699 --> 00:32:32.367
So you're saying... [chuckles]

643
00:32:32.368 --> 00:32:34.160
- Yeah.
- Where did you take this?

644
00:32:34.161 --> 00:32:35.912
That's the Eden Hotel, right?

645
00:32:35.913 --> 00:32:38.247
I took this yesterday
just after lunchtime.

646
00:32:38.248 --> 00:32:40.083
- Really?
- Two soldiers with a delivery bag,

647
00:32:40.084 --> 00:32:41.167
acting all funny.

648
00:32:41.168 --> 00:32:43.002
Is one of them your boyfriend?

649
00:32:43.003 --> 00:32:45.046
- And you can tell just from that?
- Yeah.

650
00:32:45.047 --> 00:32:47.256
There's no way you could tell.
No one could.

651
00:32:47.257 --> 00:32:48.217
[Young-joo sighs]

652
00:32:50.636 --> 00:32:51.762
Jae-yoon.

653
00:32:53.222 --> 00:32:54.056
[sobs]

654
00:32:59.269 --> 00:33:00.269
Jae-yoon, the overseas roaming
isn't working well here,

655
00:33:00.270 --> 00:33:01.771
so I can't get through.
We are fine, so don't worry.

656
00:33:01.772 --> 00:33:02.980
Africa is still peaceful
without anything going on.

657
00:33:02.981 --> 00:33:03.940
How's it going there?

658
00:33:03.941 --> 00:33:05.692
Things are not so good in here, Mom.

659
00:33:05.693 --> 00:33:07.568
If things get weird in Africa as well,
you must never leave the hotel.

660
00:33:07.569 --> 00:33:08.861
{\an8}You're in danger, son.
Don't go outside the unit.

661
00:33:08.862 --> 00:33:10.947
{\an8}Dad wants you to stay in the unit
until things calm down there.

662
00:33:10.948 --> 00:33:12.491
{\an8}Okay, Mom. Don't worry.

663
00:33:17.955 --> 00:33:18.997
[sighs]

664
00:33:26.004 --> 00:33:26.964
[Young-man sighs]

665
00:33:30.634 --> 00:33:32.636
[whimsical music playing]

666
00:33:34.722 --> 00:33:36.223
[Sung-wook sniffles]

667
00:33:38.308 --> 00:33:39.893
Did you talk to your grandma?

668
00:33:40.102 --> 00:33:41.853
[Young-man] She's not answering.

669
00:33:41.854 --> 00:33:45.858
[exhales] Don't get too worried about it.
I'm sure she's okay.

670
00:33:47.818 --> 00:33:48.985
You're in Busan, yeah?

671
00:33:48.986 --> 00:33:51.028
- I live in Gaepo-dong.
- Say that again?

672
00:33:51.029 --> 00:33:52.823
Gaepo-dong... not Busan.

673
00:33:54.074 --> 00:33:55.658
You just look like someone from Busan.

674
00:33:55.659 --> 00:33:57.286
I'm not. What do you mean?

675
00:33:58.704 --> 00:34:01.248
[mimics Young-man] What do you mean,
"what do you mean", Sir?

676
00:34:01.623 --> 00:34:03.625
[whimsical music playing]

677
00:34:05.627 --> 00:34:07.337
So which way is it, then?

678
00:34:10.132 --> 00:34:11.340
[Young-man] That way.

679
00:34:11.341 --> 00:34:13.093
[Tae-hwa] No. Gaepo-dong is that way.

680
00:34:20.267 --> 00:34:22.478
I think it's time you finish
your daydreaming.

681
00:34:24.104 --> 00:34:25.606
Yes, sir. You're right.

682
00:34:26.690 --> 00:34:27.941
I'll go to the barracks now.

683
00:34:35.741 --> 00:34:38.201
- [Tae-hwa sighs]
- [Sung-wook clears throat]

684
00:34:38.202 --> 00:34:41.789
I wanted to ask...
did you had a chance to call your wife?

685
00:34:42.498 --> 00:34:46.751
No, I didn't. No.
[inhales sharply] Not for a long time.

686
00:34:46.752 --> 00:34:48.670
[clicks tongue]
She's more like an ex-wife.

687
00:34:49.463 --> 00:34:51.256
[Tae-hwa clicks tongue] Wow, that's tough.

688
00:34:51.465 --> 00:34:52.591
But, uh...

689
00:34:56.303 --> 00:34:58.262
You need to make sure
you call your folks...

690
00:34:58.263 --> 00:34:59.847
their safety is important.

691
00:34:59.848 --> 00:35:02.559
[inhales deeply] Yeah.

692
00:35:04.353 --> 00:35:07.105
Got some smokes, by chance?

693
00:35:08.315 --> 00:35:09.233
I'm all out.

694
00:35:13.904 --> 00:35:16.448
Someone must've taken
my cigarette when I put it down...

695
00:35:19.076 --> 00:35:21.703
[sniffles] Is it gonna be okay?

696
00:35:22.704 --> 00:35:26.123
[Tae-shik] Don't worry.
In these times, you're safer as a soldier.

697
00:35:26.124 --> 00:35:28.877
- [Jin-wook] Yeah, soldiers are safer.
- I'm worried about us.

698
00:35:35.008 --> 00:35:36.676
[Tae-shik] You turning your phone on?

699
00:35:36.677 --> 00:35:37.635
{\an8}[Jin-wook] Are you?

700
00:35:37.636 --> 00:35:39.762
{\an8}JAE-YOON - NOW

701
00:35:39.763 --> 00:35:42.098
[breathing heavily] Jae-yoon.

702
00:35:42.099 --> 00:35:44.392
- You get in touch?
- Did you get in touch?

703
00:35:44.393 --> 00:35:45.935
[Jae-yoon] <i>Young-joo are you okay?</i>

704
00:35:45.936 --> 00:35:47.854
<i>You're okay, right? I'm fine.</i>

705
00:35:47.855 --> 00:35:50.607
<i>Don't tell me that you're trying
to come and find me.</i>

706
00:35:52.943 --> 00:35:55.027
<i>Hide somewhere safe, okay?</i>

707
00:35:55.028 --> 00:35:57.781
<i>Just tell me where you are
and I'll come and find you.</i>

708
00:35:58.448 --> 00:35:59.741
He said he's okay.

709
00:36:00.659 --> 00:36:02.369
What did I say? Try not to worry.

710
00:36:02.995 --> 00:36:04.329
- Thank God.
- Thank God.

711
00:36:05.372 --> 00:36:06.205
CALLING... JAE-YOON

712
00:36:06.206 --> 00:36:08.625
- [Tae-shik] Why are you copying?
- [Jin-wook] I didn't.

713
00:36:09.376 --> 00:36:11.377
[Young-joo sniffling, sobbing]

714
00:36:11.378 --> 00:36:12.962
[line ringing]

715
00:36:12.963 --> 00:36:16.173
[voicemail] <i>The person you are trying
to reach is currently unavailable.</i>

716
00:36:16.174 --> 00:36:18.719
<i>When you hear the beep,
please leave your message.</i>

717
00:36:19.511 --> 00:36:20.345
[call ends]

718
00:36:22.723 --> 00:36:26.602
Because of high volume,
it didn't go through.

719
00:36:27.185 --> 00:36:29.937
Don't worry about it.
Just wait a bit, it'll work out.

720
00:36:29.938 --> 00:36:31.439
Yeah, wait. It'll work.

721
00:36:31.440 --> 00:36:33.357
[Tae-shik] You know you're doing it again.

722
00:36:33.358 --> 00:36:34.609
[Jin-wook] Huh?

723
00:36:34.610 --> 00:36:36.777
I think I might have to go to A tower now.

724
00:36:36.778 --> 00:36:38.655
No. What? That'd be insane.

725
00:36:39.114 --> 00:36:40.698
I mean, look out the window. Come on!

726
00:36:40.699 --> 00:36:44.202
I appreciate all your help, Jin-wook.
I swear I won't forget you.

727
00:36:44.828 --> 00:36:46.914
Alex, thank you
from the bottom of my heart.

728
00:36:47.664 --> 00:36:48.624
I'm gonna go now.

729
00:36:49.333 --> 00:36:52.294
- What? Hey... Wait!
- Young-joo, hey!

730
00:36:53.295 --> 00:36:54.212
I'll go, too.

731
00:36:57.299 --> 00:36:59.717
- [Young-joo] Why?
- We should go together,

732
00:36:59.718 --> 00:37:03.555
since I'm headed to the hotel,
because that's where I left my car.

733
00:37:04.556 --> 00:37:07.059
And two is better than one.
Or better than--

734
00:37:09.394 --> 00:37:10.228
[sighs]

735
00:37:11.104 --> 00:37:12.064
And what about you?

736
00:37:15.108 --> 00:37:15.943
Oh...

737
00:37:17.527 --> 00:37:18.403
Son of a bitch.

738
00:37:19.154 --> 00:37:20.613
That's all of our ramyun?

739
00:37:20.614 --> 00:37:23.366
That's right.
Last night the privates on night shift

740
00:37:23.367 --> 00:37:25.451
ate everything else for a midnight snack.

741
00:37:25.452 --> 00:37:26.953
[Tae-hwa] How long will it last?

742
00:37:26.954 --> 00:37:28.413
The next two days.

743
00:37:29.081 --> 00:37:31.124
[all sighing simultaneously]

744
00:37:31.917 --> 00:37:34.127
So, what's this?

745
00:37:35.212 --> 00:37:36.755
That is a war ration.

746
00:37:37.339 --> 00:37:38.674
[Soo-jeong] Ah!

747
00:37:41.009 --> 00:37:43.678
- That looks bad.
- It's not just bad. It's the worst.

748
00:37:43.679 --> 00:37:45.013
Before we eat...

749
00:37:46.765 --> 00:37:48.350
I have an announcement to make.

750
00:37:48.809 --> 00:37:51.353
- We're running low on food.
- [electricity crackling]

751
00:37:51.937 --> 00:37:53.397
[all exclaiming]

752
00:37:53.939 --> 00:37:55.941
[Sung-wook] Did they kill the grid?

753
00:37:56.942 --> 00:37:57.859
[Jae-yoon] What kid?

754
00:37:58.735 --> 00:37:59.860
[Soo-jeong] What kid?

755
00:37:59.861 --> 00:38:01.153
[Sung-wook] The grid.

756
00:38:01.154 --> 00:38:02.322
[Jae-yoon] Oh, the grid...

757
00:38:03.573 --> 00:38:04.448
[gasps]

758
00:38:04.449 --> 00:38:07.034
Are you picking your nose
at the table, you little shit?

759
00:38:07.035 --> 00:38:08.911
Private Ra In-ho. I'm so sorry.

760
00:38:08.912 --> 00:38:10.872
[Jae-yoon] Dude. Ugh!

761
00:38:11.456 --> 00:38:12.874
- Ay, hey!
- You... You can't--

762
00:38:13.500 --> 00:38:14.875
What are you doing, dude?

763
00:38:14.876 --> 00:38:15.794
[In-ho gasps]

764
00:38:17.963 --> 00:38:19.755
{\an8}[Tae-hwa] We have
two days' worth of food...

765
00:38:19.756 --> 00:38:21.757
{\an8}- [In-ho gasps]
- ...if we eat normal portions.

766
00:38:21.758 --> 00:38:24.760
I need you to understand
that we'll have to eat sparingly...

767
00:38:24.761 --> 00:38:27.013
- Now we can't call anybody.
- [Jae-yoon] Huh?

768
00:38:27.014 --> 00:38:29.265
[Tae-hwa] ...the timeline
for that resupply is--

769
00:38:29.266 --> 00:38:32.727
- Ah! Are you serious?
- I think we're going to lose power again.

770
00:38:32.728 --> 00:38:35.354
You'd think a building of this size
would use an ATS?

771
00:38:35.355 --> 00:38:36.397
Be quiet, man.

772
00:38:36.398 --> 00:38:39.608
Usually there is an ATS
between the outside grid and generator.

773
00:38:39.609 --> 00:38:41.903
- [Tae-hwa] Who's talking?
- [both] Sir, sorry.

774
00:38:43.405 --> 00:38:44.406
As I was saying...

775
00:38:46.241 --> 00:38:48.452
Let's, no matter how hard,
share this burden...

776
00:38:49.619 --> 00:38:50.954
and maintain our strength.

777
00:38:51.580 --> 00:38:52.831
I know this isn't much...

778
00:38:54.249 --> 00:38:55.416
but it's all we've got.

779
00:38:55.417 --> 00:38:56.375
[Young-man sighs]

780
00:38:56.376 --> 00:38:57.668
I'm good with a cup noodle.

781
00:38:57.669 --> 00:38:59.421
A few cup noodles,

782
00:39:01.173 --> 00:39:02.132
that's all...

783
00:39:04.176 --> 00:39:06.177
And with these struggling kids...

784
00:39:06.178 --> 00:39:09.639
seeing them have to eat rice
without any soup,

785
00:39:10.974 --> 00:39:12.934
it makes my heart break a little bit.

786
00:39:14.853 --> 00:39:16.645
- Gye-young.
- Corporal Kwak Gye-young.

787
00:39:16.646 --> 00:39:17.563
Boil some water.

788
00:39:17.564 --> 00:39:20.859
Yes, sir. I'm on it.
Hey, you're good, eat.

789
00:39:24.488 --> 00:39:26.447
- I'll be back.
- [Tae-hwa] Let's eat.

790
00:39:26.448 --> 00:39:28.324
[all] Have a good meal.

791
00:39:28.325 --> 00:39:29.493
Have a good meal.

792
00:39:31.495 --> 00:39:33.872
- Hyung-bae, we gotta eat.
- Sir, I'm sorry.

793
00:39:37.501 --> 00:39:39.503
[indistinct snarling]

794
00:39:40.504 --> 00:39:41.712
[Young-joo panting]

795
00:39:41.713 --> 00:39:43.799
- [Jin-wook] Whoa, whoa.
- [Tae-shik] What?

796
00:39:44.800 --> 00:39:46.509
[Young-joo breathing heavily]

797
00:39:46.510 --> 00:39:48.511
- Right there.
- [Young-joo] Where do we go?

798
00:39:48.512 --> 00:39:50.514
[Jin-wook] Let's go. Come on, come on.

799
00:39:51.348 --> 00:39:52.849
[squelching]

800
00:39:56.061 --> 00:39:58.604
- [Young-joo gasping]
- [Jin-wook] Oh, oh.

801
00:39:58.605 --> 00:39:59.688
This way, this way.

802
00:39:59.689 --> 00:40:01.066
Go, go.

803
00:40:07.405 --> 00:40:09.240
[Jin-wook] Quick, quick. Be careful.

804
00:40:09.241 --> 00:40:11.201
- [squelching]
- [snarling]

805
00:40:21.419 --> 00:40:24.881
- Is the right way to get to A tower?
- Yeah, but it looks like it.

806
00:40:25.632 --> 00:40:27.092
Did you turn off your phones?

807
00:40:27.843 --> 00:40:29.552
I put it on silent. We're good.

808
00:40:29.553 --> 00:40:31.053
You said shut 'em down!

809
00:40:31.054 --> 00:40:34.474
- [sighs] Jin-wook. Let's just keep moving.
- [Jin-wook] We have to--

810
00:40:35.600 --> 00:40:37.185
Still mad you lost yours?

811
00:40:37.894 --> 00:40:39.896
[distant snarling]

812
00:40:40.772 --> 00:40:42.232
- [Jin-wook] Ooh.
- [gasps]

813
00:40:46.653 --> 00:40:47.654
[grunts]

814
00:40:48.488 --> 00:40:51.283
[Jin-wook] Damn. You're so clumsy.

815
00:40:51.867 --> 00:40:53.702
- Are you okay?
- Yeah. Yeah, I'm fine.

816
00:40:53.952 --> 00:40:55.370
Your shoes are both untied.

817
00:40:57.622 --> 00:40:59.624
[melancholy music playing]

818
00:41:02.043 --> 00:41:03.044
[Young-joo sniffles]

819
00:41:07.883 --> 00:41:09.384
[Jae-yoon] First, like this...

820
00:41:10.677 --> 00:41:12.596
<i>- And then under...</i>
- [Young-joo sobbing]

821
00:41:13.346 --> 00:41:14.389
[Jae-yoon] <i>Like this.</i>

822
00:41:22.647 --> 00:41:23.815
God.

823
00:41:26.234 --> 00:41:27.194
[Hyung-bae burps]

824
00:41:28.361 --> 00:41:29.237
[Tae-hwa] Huh?

825
00:41:29.988 --> 00:41:31.198
I swear to God...

826
00:41:32.115 --> 00:41:33.825
[sighs] Uh.

827
00:41:34.117 --> 00:41:34.951
[Young-man] Hmm?

828
00:41:36.369 --> 00:41:37.370
[strained slurping]

829
00:41:38.371 --> 00:41:40.373
- We have a problem.
- What is it?

830
00:41:40.916 --> 00:41:43.000
Choi Chul-woo got bit, immediately died,

831
00:41:43.001 --> 00:41:44.960
but we didn't see him turn into a zombie.

832
00:41:44.961 --> 00:41:47.214
- Okay.
- That's true.

833
00:41:48.006 --> 00:41:49.883
But then, with Chef Jung...

834
00:41:50.592 --> 00:41:52.135
He turned almost immediately.

835
00:41:52.886 --> 00:41:54.387
- [banging on door]
- [all gasping]

836
00:41:55.805 --> 00:41:58.391
- [banging continues]
- [In-ho gasps]

837
00:42:00.143 --> 00:42:01.186
[all exclaiming]

838
00:42:02.437 --> 00:42:04.356
- [banging continues]
- [In-ho] Oh, shit.

839
00:42:07.150 --> 00:42:09.693
- Did you check all of the doors?
- Of course, sir.

840
00:42:09.694 --> 00:42:11.238
I checked every last one myself.

841
00:42:13.323 --> 00:42:15.158
[In-ho and Soo-jeong whimpering]

842
00:42:16.952 --> 00:42:18.078
[pressure cooker whistling]

843
00:42:18.995 --> 00:42:21.997
[gasps] What if they don't change
right when they're bitten?

844
00:42:21.998 --> 00:42:23.166
Oh, my God.

845
00:42:25.794 --> 00:42:27.045
[banging continues]

846
00:42:30.590 --> 00:42:31.423
[grunts]

847
00:42:31.424 --> 00:42:33.050
[Soo-jeong gasps]

848
00:42:33.051 --> 00:42:34.344
[Chul-woo snarling]

849
00:42:35.470 --> 00:42:37.179
- [Hyung-bae] Choi--
- [Young-man] Huh?

850
00:42:37.180 --> 00:42:38.889
[Tae-hwa] Ch-- Choi Chul-woo?

851
00:42:38.890 --> 00:42:41.267
- [chuckles] Chul-woo!
- Don't go out there.

852
00:42:41.268 --> 00:42:43.978
- [Hyung-bae] Chul-woo.
- [Soo-jeong] Don't go. Close the door.

853
00:42:43.979 --> 00:42:44.938
Hey.

854
00:42:46.356 --> 00:42:48.233
- [snarling]
- [Hyung-bae] Chul-woo.

855
00:42:48.817 --> 00:42:51.236
- [grunting]
- [snarling]

856
00:42:54.739 --> 00:42:55.949
[Hyung-bae whimpering]

857
00:42:58.201 --> 00:43:00.160
[moaning]

858
00:43:00.161 --> 00:43:01.913
[yelling]

859
00:43:10.839 --> 00:43:13.465
- [Gye-young] Someone get him.
- [Young-man] Wait.

860
00:43:13.466 --> 00:43:14.968
[Gye-young whimpers]

861
00:43:15.552 --> 00:43:17.387
- [Chul-woo snarls]
- [all shouting]

862
00:43:21.308 --> 00:43:23.517
- [Hyung-bae] Chul-woo.
- [Gye-young] Hyung-bae

863
00:43:23.518 --> 00:43:27.146
I'm sorry that I asked you
to do the guillotine choke.

864
00:43:27.147 --> 00:43:28.939
- Hyung-bae!
- [Chul-woo snarls]

865
00:43:28.940 --> 00:43:29.858
Hyung-bae.

866
00:43:32.819 --> 00:43:34.778
- [Gye-young] We got you.
- [Jae-yoon] Oh!

867
00:43:34.779 --> 00:43:36.448
[Tae-hwa grunts]

868
00:43:37.240 --> 00:43:38.615
Bring me a rifle and a blanket.

869
00:43:38.616 --> 00:43:39.909
Private Hwang Kyung-sik!

870
00:43:40.452 --> 00:43:42.161
[Gye-young] Corporal Jeon Hyung-bae!

871
00:43:42.162 --> 00:43:43.787
Hyung-bae, are you okay?

872
00:43:43.788 --> 00:43:45.164
You're gonna get killed.

873
00:43:45.165 --> 00:43:46.374
I got an idea.

874
00:43:52.505 --> 00:43:53.923
Yeah, yeah.

875
00:43:54.632 --> 00:43:57.051
Come on, quick! Hurry up!

876
00:43:57.052 --> 00:43:58.053
[Gye-young] Help me!

877
00:43:58.553 --> 00:43:59.887
[shouting]

878
00:43:59.888 --> 00:44:01.055
I'm going in.

879
00:44:01.056 --> 00:44:03.141
[Tae-hwa yelping]

880
00:44:04.434 --> 00:44:06.144
[Jae-yoon grunts]

881
00:44:07.187 --> 00:44:08.270
[Chul-woo snarls]

882
00:44:08.271 --> 00:44:10.522
Are you still with me? Hyung-bae?

883
00:44:10.523 --> 00:44:11.858
- Hyung-bae.
- He's not--

884
00:44:15.487 --> 00:44:17.613
I'm gonna do CPR.
Please secure the airway.

885
00:44:17.614 --> 00:44:20.407
- What're you doing?
- What am I-- It's CPR!

886
00:44:20.408 --> 00:44:22.452
Ugh, you're supposed to know this shit.

887
00:44:23.119 --> 00:44:26.038
He can't die this way.
Then he'll turn into a zombie.

888
00:44:26.039 --> 00:44:27.123
[Gye-young] Okay.

889
00:44:28.375 --> 00:44:31.877
One, two, three, four
five, six, seven, eight...

890
00:44:31.878 --> 00:44:32.961
nine, ten.

891
00:44:32.962 --> 00:44:35.714
One, two, three, four five, six--

892
00:44:35.715 --> 00:44:36.965
- Wait.
- You can--

893
00:44:36.966 --> 00:44:38.384
No, his head!

894
00:44:38.385 --> 00:44:41.095
- Oh, shit.
- Oh. Bring us a towel.

895
00:44:41.096 --> 00:44:42.304
What? You want--

896
00:44:42.305 --> 00:44:44.765
- [Soo-jeong] Please, just--
- [In-ho] Okay.

897
00:44:44.766 --> 00:44:46.475
[Jae-yoon] Ah! He's gonna kill me.

898
00:44:46.476 --> 00:44:47.393
[In-ho grunting]

899
00:44:47.394 --> 00:44:49.186
[Jae-yoon] ...kill me. Oh, God.

900
00:44:49.187 --> 00:44:51.314
- [In-ho yelling]
- [Jae-yoon] Get it, get it.

901
00:44:53.441 --> 00:44:55.317
- [rifle cocks]
- Now, get back!

902
00:44:55.318 --> 00:44:57.653
- Young-man, are you ready?
- Yes, sir. I'm ready.

903
00:44:57.654 --> 00:45:00.198
- Fire!
- [In-ho whimpers]

904
00:45:01.699 --> 00:45:02.950
[Chul-woo thuds]

905
00:45:02.951 --> 00:45:05.828
[In-ho panting]

906
00:45:05.829 --> 00:45:08.288
- [Chul-woo snarls]
- [In-ho shouts, yelps]

907
00:45:08.289 --> 00:45:11.542
- Oh, shit. What do we do?
- You have to shoot him in the head.

908
00:45:11.543 --> 00:45:13.043
- Open fire!
- [In-ho gasps]

909
00:45:13.044 --> 00:45:14.671
[shell casing clanks on floor]

910
00:45:15.380 --> 00:45:17.382
[serious music playing]

911
00:46:21.696 --> 00:46:23.698
[whimsical music playing]

912
00:47:51.244 --> 00:47:53.246
[marching band music playing]

913
00:49:06.861 --> 00:49:08.905
[chaotic music playing]

914
00:50:13.469 --> 00:50:15.471
[music fades out]

